{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2021-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1635033600, "end_date": 1635724799, "month_true_total": 512, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:19:42 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "101999076", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040727302", "personaname": "Reverend Revenant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/armorhide406/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 1143, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 756, "last_played": 1669512857, "avatar": "41e5aa1637ff171b52ebf3f1fec49749a3f13cd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game over, man! Game over!\nLike Space Hulk: Deathwing it's best played with friends. Randos are alright too I guess. I hope they add saved loadouts and more campaigns", "timestamp_created": 1635724757, "timestamp_updated": 1635724757, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101994237", "author": {"steamid": "76561198194625187", "personaname": "HORSE VIOLENCE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198194625187/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 399, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 399, "last_played": 1631493738, "avatar": "5f0768536cf3693e93b26b3b26a9d38af989f013"}, "language": "english", "review": "released way too early and incredibly repetitive, it will probably be fun and worth playing in a year or two", "timestamp_created": 1635718562, "timestamp_updated": 1635718562, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101991985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090987453", "personaname": "Pan Vic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/77891351221694207/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 229, "last_played": 1645986751, "avatar": "fab32d5d7261d73e15dc105bc704823f92b15c38"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun to play alone and with friends, well balanced and multiple playstyles. Would recommend.", "timestamp_created": 1635715840, "timestamp_updated": 1635715840, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101987624", "author": {"steamid": "76561198305620464", "personaname": "bradmore88", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198305620464/", "num_games_owned": 27, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 580, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 526, "last_played": 1635714475, "avatar": "a8091fa7e1c73cf1289ef49f74e105e0c0f5562f"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game if not a bit repitative", "timestamp_created": 1635711251, "timestamp_updated": 1635711251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101985885", "author": {"steamid": "76561198368953900", "personaname": "Gabe Itch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198368953900/", "num_games_owned": 292, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 2123, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 192, "last_played": 1682561478, "avatar": "4c774312c4805932972761b6391fbd245965452c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Would really love the ability to have a custom made character for each or at least the ability to have multiple character saves to chose from.", "timestamp_created": 1635709439, "timestamp_updated": 1635709439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101975553", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047527464", "personaname": "DETWERKS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047527464/", "num_games_owned": 110, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 21488, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11037, "last_played": 1714206657, "avatar": "618bfa7e8477cee17e56637af632fef4e31724b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Edit 12/21:\n\nIf you have friends to play with, this is might be a good buy. If you want a multiplayer experience with random players or go at it solo...at this time, it wouldn't be such. For a small company, Cold Iron Studio made a solid Aliens game, but also a game that has a LOT of room for improvement. I started off with a thumbs-up because I only paid $40 and got way more than 40 hours of fun out of it. Eventually I changed my mind because since release it's still missing basic in-game chat and cross-platform capability. The devs have also forbidden multiplayer access if you are using downloadable mods (which improved the game's terrible AI bots, allowed field of vision adjustments which were missing in the game's options, and improved some class abilities).\n\nIf you want the full story behind the game, read the prequel novel Aliens: Infiltrator. I recommend it if you're interested in learning much more about Tim Hoenikker, how he got into the mess your team saves him from, and why you're facing new types of xenomorphs in-game", "timestamp_created": 1635699440, "timestamp_updated": 1640132843, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101974763", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995722619", "personaname": "Abdulmalik (TH)", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995722619/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 1456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 568, "last_played": 1662447201, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game lack of content and so repetitive.\nI am a fan of Alien series but I cannot fool myself anymore.\nAliens: Fireteam Elite is boring.\nThe playerbase is dying.\nAlthough I love the concept of this game,\nBut It is torment If you grind to unlock all contents.", "timestamp_created": 1635698640, "timestamp_updated": 1637715072, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101969976", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969379991", "personaname": "Grandmaster of Pwn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969379991/", "num_games_owned": 1216, "num_reviews": 516, "playtime_forever": 643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 165, "last_played": 1637503483, "avatar": "3a57aa6dfd27d1c712b0d6559163b8befad64dac"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun coop shooter. nothing extraordinary, but very well done. great aliens atmosphere. 8/10\ni'm playing this game with my bro exclusively. i can understand that this might not be so good if you dont have dedicated people to play with.", "timestamp_created": 1635694315, "timestamp_updated": 1635695523, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}